				<wikidot:authorName>Deacon_Blues_117</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>630856</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Very few people snap all at once. The edges have to crumble first. The entire personality has to become friable. Then, given the correct (or incorrect) pressure, they can snap like a stale snickerdoodle, scattering crumbs of lost sanity and overextended metaphor all over the place.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
