					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Actually, I mostly find it interesting (if it plays out that way) that they knew each other before the Foundation. Or that it's a mutual <em>&quot;You got me into this!&quot; &quot;No, it's YOU'RE fault!&quot;</em> sort of thing. (And &quot;<strong>Lean On Me</strong>&quot; comes on with &quot;<em>&#8230;I just might have a problem that you'd understand&#8230;</em>&quot; as I type that&#8230;)</p> <p>edit: &#8230;followed by <strong>Veteran Of The Psychic Wars</strong> whose entire lyrics are apropos of this story line&#8230;</p> 
				 	]]>
